        <calculation class='tableau' formula='LOOKUP([% of Women in leadership M2+ (copy)_1246089775269900304],-DATEPART(&apos;month&apos;, TODAY())+2)&#13;&#10;//LOOKUP([% of All Women],-DATEPART(&apos;month&apos;, TODAY())+1)'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='All Men (YoY) %' datatype='real' default-format='p0.0%' name='[All Women (YoY) % (copy)_1927259173645398044]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='LOOKUP([% of Women in leadership (All Women) (copy)_1727693413668200450],-12)'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='u.User Filter (Data Source level)' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_1020065330459856901]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='STR(IF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Administrator (People Analytics Team)&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF USERNAME()=(&apos;benjamin.mann@deliveryhero.com&apos;) THEN &#13;&#10;IF [department] = &apos;DH Tech&apos; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF USERNAME()=(&apos;abdulrahman.alswaha@hungerstation.com&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;ELSEIF USERNAME()=(&apos;batuhan.sagirdas@deliveryhero.com&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;ELSEIF USERNAME()=(&apos;inna.skochko@deliveryhero.com&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;ELSEIF USERNAME()=(&apos;laura.martinpastor@glovoapp.com&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;ELSEIF USERNAME()=(&apos;sibel.kundes@deliveryhero.com&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;ELSEIF USERNAME()=(&apos;thom.van@deliveryhero.com&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;DH People Leadership&apos;) THEN 1 &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;eFood - Administrator&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;DH Europe - Administrator&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Foodpanda - Administrator&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Foodpanda - Administrator Limited&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Hungerstation - Administrator&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Pedidos Ya - Administrator&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Talabat - Administrator&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Yemeksepeti - Administrator&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Glovo - Administrator&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Glovo - People Leadership&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Glovo - People Partners&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Glovo - Talent Development&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;Glovo - Total Rewards&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF ISMEMBEROF(&apos;People - PMO&apos;) THEN 1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;END)' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_management level (tooltip)' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_1194861282907471873]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [Parameters].[Parameter 7] = &quot;Overall&quot; THEN &quot;All Management Levels&quot; ELSE STR([Parameters].[Parameter 7]) END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_Overall KPI subtitle (Entity name)' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_1221038458168692739]' role='measure' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF MIN([company_name]) = MAX([company_name]) THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;(&quot; + MIN([company_name]) + &quot;)&quot;&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    &quot;&quot;&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_filter Month (Glovo)' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_1616792279637213184]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [brand] = &quot;Glovo&quot; AND &#13;&#10;    (   &#13;&#10;        [report_month] &lt; DATE(&quot;2024-05-01&quot;)&#13;&#10;        /*YEAR([report_month]) = 2024 &#13;&#10;        AND (&#13;&#10;            MONTH([report_month]) = 1 &#13;&#10;            OR MONTH([report_month]) = 2 &#13;&#10;            OR MONTH([report_month]) = 3 &#13;&#10;            OR MONTH([report_month]) = 4&#13;&#10;        )*/&#13;&#10;    ) &#13;&#10;THEN&#13;&#10;    TRUE&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    FALSE&#13;&#10;END&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;// Created this field to manually hide specific month range as the data for this time period is not yet accurate' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Brand Parameter' datatype='integer' name='[Calculation_1624110623685439488]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [brand]=[Parameters].[Parameter 12] OR [brand]=[Parameters].[Attribute 1 (copy)_2261088533158469635] OR [brand]=[Parameters].[Attribute 2 (copy)_2261088533159288837] THEN &#13;&#10;    1 &#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    0&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_Brand select' datatype='real' default-format='p0.0%' name='[Calculation_1624110623687286785]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Select Mgmt Level (copy)_1952028970592219156] &#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M1+&quot; THEN [% of Women in leadership M2+ (copy)_105834602255769601]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M2+&quot; THEN [% of Women in leadership M3+ (copy)_5615988778474348558]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M3+&quot; THEN [Calculation_5615988778463821834]&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_Overall KPI Title (Brand)' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_1646628624710795266]' role='measure' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF MIN([brand]) = &quot;EFood&quot; THEN &#13;&#10;    &quot;efood&quot;     // Lowercase Efood&#13;&#10;ELSEIF MIN([brand]) = MAX([brand]) THEN&#13;&#10;    MIN([brand])  // Display the single selected brand&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    // Check if all selected brands are part of the Pandora group&#13;&#10;    IF MIN([brand]) IN (&quot;Foodpanda&quot;, &quot;Foodora&quot;, &quot;Yemeksepeti&quot;) &#13;&#10;       AND MAX([brand]) IN (&quot;Foodpanda&quot;, &quot;Foodora&quot;, &quot;Yemeksepeti&quot;) THEN&#13;&#10;        &quot;Pandora&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSE&#13;&#10;       &quot;Multiple Brands Selected&quot; &#13;&#10;    END&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='All Women (YoY) %' datatype='real' default-format='p0.0%' name='[Calculation_1727693413671366659]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='LOOKUP([% of Women in leadership M2+ (copy)_1246089775269900304],-12)'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='_management_level (select)' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_1857171902607921153]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Parameter 7]  &#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M1+&quot; THEN [management_level (group) M2+ (copy)_105834602256068612]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M2+&quot; THEN [management_level (group) M3+ (copy)_5615988778385653760]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M3+&quot; THEN [management_level (group) M3+] &#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;Overall&quot; THEN &quot;Overall&quot;&#13;&#10;END' />
        <aliases>
          <alias key='&quot;M Level and above&quot;' value='M1+' />
        </aliases>
      </column>
      <column caption='_latest month' datatype='date' name='[Calculation_1857171902618923011]' role='dimension' type='ordinal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='{MAX([report_month])}' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_Brand Params 1' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_1927259173611081728]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='[brand] = [Parameters].[Parameter 12]' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_sort stacked bar by dept/sub-dept' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_1927259173620318227]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Parameter 7] &#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M3+&quot; THEN [Calculation_5615988778463821834]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M2+&quot; THEN [% of Women in leadership M3+ (copy)_5615988778474348558]&#13;&#10;    ELSE [% of Women in leadership M2+ (copy)_1246089775269900304]&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_Show stacked bar (Dept/Sub-Dept)' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_1927259173621112852]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [Parameters].[Parameter 13] = &quot;Department&quot; OR [Parameters].[Parameter 13] = &quot;Sub-Department&quot;&#13;&#10;    THEN TRUE &#13;&#10;ELSE &#13;&#10;    FALSE &#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Color M+ Women (yoy)' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_1927259173653778463]' role='measure' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Select Mgmt Level (copy)_1952028970592219156] &#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M3+&quot; THEN [Calculation_5615988778807431186]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M2+&quot; THEN [Color M3+ yoy (copy)_2261088533099188224]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M1+&quot; THEN [Color M2+ Women (yoy) (copy)_105834602260537350]&#13;&#10;END'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='M+ Women (YoY) %' datatype='real' default-format='p0.0%' name='[Calculation_1927259173654478880]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Select Mgmt Level (copy)_1952028970592219156] &#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M3+&quot; THEN [Calculation_2322731514238955554]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M2+&quot; THEN [_M3+ Women (YoY) % (copy)_2322731514245128232]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M1+&quot; THEN [_M2+ Women (YoY) % (copy)_105834602260287493]&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;END'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='_filter As of date' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_1927259173683331133]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;,[report_month]) &lt;= DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;, DATEADD(&apos;month&apos;,-1,today()))&#13;&#10;THEN &#13;&#10;    TRUE&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    FALSE&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_filter YTD' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_1952028970599157781]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='/*DATEPART(&apos;year&apos;, [report_month]) = DATEPART(&apos;year&apos;, TODAY())&#13;&#10;AND [report_month] &lt;= TODAY()*/&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;IF DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;,[report_month]) &lt;= DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;, DATEADD(&apos;month&apos;,-1,today())) &#13;&#10;    AND YEAR([report_month]) = YEAR(TODAY()) &#13;&#10;THEN &#13;&#10;    TRUE&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    FALSE&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_INDEX()' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_2322731514126688264]' role='measure' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='INDEX()=1&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;//Used to hide 2nd column (&quot;others&quot;) in the 100% Stacked bar chart by gender'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
        <desc>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Used to hide 2nd column (&quot;others&quot;) in the 100% Stacked bar chart by gender</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </desc>
      </column>
      <column caption='_M3+ Women (YoY) %' datatype='real' default-format='p0.0%' name='[Calculation_2322731514238955554]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='LOOKUP([Calculation_5615988778463821834],-12)'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='_filter YoY' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_2322731514242850853]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='[report_month] &gt;= DATEADD(&apos;month&apos;, -11, [Parameters].[Parameter 15 1])&#13;&#10;AND [report_month] &lt;= TODAY()' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_% of Women (vs Target)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_2352004915400507405]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='// Calculate the last value of M2+/M3+ Women for the most recent month&#13;&#10;IF LAST() = 0 THEN&#13;&#10;    [Calculation_426716073177571336]&#13;&#10;END&#13;&#10;-&#13;&#10;[Calculation_426716073178509321]'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='_Color (Title - Green)' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_2352004915403087886]' role='measure' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='WINDOW_MAX(&#13;&#10;    IF [Calculation_2352004915400507405] &gt; 0 THEN &#13;&#10;        &quot;▲ &quot; + STR(ROUND(ABS([Calculation_2352004915400507405]) * 100, 1)) + &quot;%&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSE &#13;&#10;        &quot;&quot; &#13;&#10;    END&#13;&#10;)'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='Is Dec PY?' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_2352004915633274912]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='//IF MONTH([report_month]) = 12  AND YEAR([report_month]) = 2023 THEN True else FALSE end&#13;&#10;IF MONTH([report_month]) = 12 AND YEAR([report_month]) = YEAR(TODAY()) - 1 THEN &#13;&#10;    TRUE &#13;&#10;ELSE &#13;&#10;    FALSE &#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='M+ Women (Latest Month)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_2352004915643686949]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF LAST() = 0 THEN&#13;&#10;    [Calculation_426716073177571336]&#13;&#10;END'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='_Headcount' datatype='integer' name='[Calculation_2428847580056133635]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='COUNTD([employee_id])' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_Measure Filter' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_2428847580057530373]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Parameter 13]&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;Management Level&quot; then [management_level]&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;Management Level Groups&quot; then [management_level (group)]&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;Tenure Category&quot; then [tenure_category]&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;Department&quot; then [Calculation_3032329939638898689] //[department]&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;Region&quot; then [region]&#13;&#10;WHEN &quot;Country&quot; then [country]&#13;&#10;END' />
        <aliases>
          <alias key='&quot;a) &lt; 90 days&quot;' value='&lt; 3 months' />
          <alias key='&quot;b) &lt; 6 months&quot;' value='3 to 6 months' />
          <alias key='&quot;c) &lt; 1 year&quot;' value='6 months to 1 year' />
          <alias key='&quot;d) &lt; 2 years&quot;' value='1 to 2 years' />
          <alias key='&quot;e) &lt; 3 years&quot;' value='2 to 3 years' />
          <alias key='&quot;f) &lt; 4 years&quot;' value='3 to 4 years' />
          <alias key='&quot;g) above&quot;' value='&gt; 4 years' />
        </aliases>
      </column>
      <column caption='Is Previous Month' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_2932124873389195296]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;,[report_month]) = DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;, DATEADD(&apos;month&apos;,-1,today())) &#13;&#10;    AND YEAR([report_month]) = YEAR(TODAY()) &#13;&#10;THEN &#13;&#10;    TRUE&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    FALSE&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='c.Filter - Department (cleaned)' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_3032329939638898689]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [brand] = &apos;Talabat&apos; THEN&#13;&#10;    IF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-2823&quot;)&#13;&#10;    THEN&#9;&#13;&#10;    (&#13;&#10;    IF  &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-1616&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;COO&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-0247&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Q-commerce&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEif &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-11-1327&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;COO&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEif &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-01-0022&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;COO&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF  &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-2825&quot;) &#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;COO&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-2813&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Tech&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-2824&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Finance and Legal&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-2830&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Product&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-08-0388&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    (if CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-2806&quot;) or CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-0158&quot;)&#13;&#10;    or CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-0244&quot;)THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Strategy and Innovation&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-2822&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Comms, Public Affairs and Sustainability&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSE&#13;&#10;    &quot;People and Culture&quot;&#13;&#10;    END)&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-2822&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Comms, Public Affairs and Sustainability&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-06-2821&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;People and Culture&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2020-09-0072&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Chief Business Office&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    CONTAINS([manager_id_concat]+[employee_id],&quot;2021-09-0243&quot;)&#9;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;Social Commerce&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    [employee_id]=&quot;2020-06-2823&quot;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;CEO&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSE&#13;&#10;    &quot;Unspecified&quot;&#13;&#10;    END&#13;&#10;    )&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF &#13;&#10;    [employee_id]=&quot;2020-06-2821&quot;&#13;&#10;    THEN&#13;&#10;    &quot;People and Culture&quot;&#13;&#10;    ELSE&#13;&#10;    &quot;DHSE&quot;&#13;&#10;    END&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    [department]&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='M+ Women' datatype='real' default-format='p0.0%' name='[Calculation_426716073177571336]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Select Mgmt Level (copy)_1952028970592219156]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M3+&quot; THEN [Calculation_5615988778463821834]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M2+&quot; THEN [% of Women in leadership M3+ (copy)_5615988778474348558]&#13;&#10;    WHEN &quot;M1+&quot; THEN [% of Women in leadership M2+ (copy)_105834602255769601]&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_Target (ref line)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_426716073178509321]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF ATTR(YEAR([report_month])) = 2024 THEN&#13;&#10;    IF COUNTD([brand]) &gt; 1 THEN&#13;&#10;        NULL  // Return NULL if multiple brands are selected&#13;&#10;    ELSEIF ATTR([company_name]) = &quot;Delivery Hero SE&quot; THEN&#13;&#10;        0.32  // Return 0.32 if the company is Delivery Hero SE&#13;&#10;    ELSE&#13;&#10;        CASE ATTR([brand])  // Use ATTR to ensure we&apos;re working with aggregated data&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;Delivery Hero&quot; THEN 0.26&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;EFood&quot; THEN 0.36&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;Foodora&quot; THEN 0.35&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;Foodpanda&quot; THEN 0.41&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;Foody&quot; THEN 0.36&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;Glovo&quot; THEN 0.35&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;Hungerstation&quot; THEN 0.10&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;PedidosYa&quot; THEN 0.22&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;Talabat&quot; THEN 0.25&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;Yemeksepeti&quot; THEN 0.35&#13;&#10;            WHEN &quot;Woowa&quot; THEN 0.23&#13;&#10;            ELSE NULL  // Handle any brand not listed&#13;&#10;        END&#13;&#10;    END&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    NULL&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_Show Women (View by Gender)' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_426716073179820043]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='[Parameters].[Parameter 17] = &quot;Women&quot;' />
      </column>
      <column caption='_Show Target KPI' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_426716073183195153]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='[brand]=&quot;Delivery Hero&quot; and [Calculation_426716073179820043] = TRUE' />
      </column>
      <column caption='yoy changes M3+ (Women)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_5615988778391859203]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='(&#13;&#10;    LOOKUP([Calculation_5615988778463821834],0)&#13;&#10;    -LOOKUP([Calculation_5615988778463821834],-12)&#13;&#10;) * 100'>
          <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
        </calculation>
      </column>
      <column caption='mom changes M3+ (Women)' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.0;-#,##0.0' name='[Calculation_5615988778395148294]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
